      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> The task requires creating a Python file named `submit_transcription.py` that submits an audio file for batch transcription using a concrete external provider. I will use the Amazon Transcribe service for this task, as it is a well-known service for batch transcription. The code will import the necessary AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) and use the Amazon Transcribe client to submit the transcription job. </thinking>\n",
